 "story": "Liverpool came from behind to draw 2-2 with Newcastle United at St. James' Park in the Premier League. Anthony Elanga gave the hosts a fifth-minute lead, assisted by William Osula, before Cody Gakpo levelled in the 55th minute, set up by Ryan Gravenberch. Joe Willock restored Newcastle's advantage two minutes later, but Dominik Szoboszlai converted a penalty in the ninth minute of added time to earn a point. The draw leaves Liverpool ninth of 18 in the Premier League table with one point from one game.",
